==History==
2024
*The Goblin Drill's Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 15/7/2024.
*On 6/8/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/8/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the second submerges’s spawned [[Goblins]] to 0 (from 1).
*On 2/10/2024, the [[Version History#Lucky Drops 2.0 Update (2/10/2024)|Lucky Drops 2.0 Update]], fixed a bug where the Evolved Goblin Drill would spawn Goblins while underground and a bug where it would sometimes push other [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] when going underground.
*On 8/10/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/10/2024)|Balance Update]], removed the damage and pushback from the first and second submerges, added a deploy time for spawned Goblins after submerge, and increased the second submerges’s spawned Goblins to 1 (from 0).
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], increased the Goblin Drill's hitpoints by 0.07% and its damage by 1.2%.
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)=|Balance Update]], increased the Evolved Goblin Drill’s first spawn time to 1 seconds (from 0.8 seconds).
*On 3/11/2025, a Balance Update, increased the first submerge's spawned Goblins to 2 (from 1)
2026

* On 2/2/2026, a Balance Update, increased the second submerges’s spawned [[Goblins]] to 2 (from 1).
* On 4/5/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the second submerge's spawned Goblins to 1 (from 2)
* On 4/8/2026, a Balance Update, the Evolved Goblin Drill's spawn damage to towers has been removed entirely (from 30% of the full spawn damage)

